OL,3,ACommentator Katie Zacharia picked as
OL,4,Anew White House press secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative commentator Katie Zacharia
OL,7,Fhas been offered the job of White House
OL,8,Fpress secretary, a White House official
OL,9,Fconfirmed to the BBC.
OL,11,FZacharia, who currently works as a
OL,12,Fcommunications adviser for Trump Media
OL,13,F& Technology Group would become the
OL,14,Fpresident's sixth chief spokesperson
OL,15,Facross his two administrations. She
OL,16,Fpreviously had a brief stint as a
OL,17,Fspokesperson at the Department of
OL,18,FHomeland Security.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
