OL,3,ACommentator Katie Zacharia picked as
OL,4,Anew White House press secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer White House Press Secretary
OL,7,FKaroline Leavitt, who left the White
OL,8,FHouse in August, has reportedly taken a
OL,9,Fjob with Fox News.
OL,11,FThe BBC has contacted Zacharia for
OL,12,Fcomment.
